==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Literally “of the old day”, from {{m|is|gamall||old}} + {{m|is|dagur||day}} (genitive ''dags''). Compare {{etyl|sv|-}} {{m|sv|gammaldags}}.

===Adjective===
